### Valid bill: 200 with the coins to give
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill": 5 }

### Bill not accepted: 400 "Invalid bill"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill": 3 }

### Not enough coins ($100 is more than the machine holds): 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill": 100 }

### Field missing: 400 "bill is required"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Null: 400 "bill is required"
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill": null }

### Empty string: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill": "" }

### Special characters: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill": "5$" }

### Decimal: 400 (not cut to 5)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill": 5.5 }

### Number as a string: 400 (not converted)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill": "5" }

### Broken JSON: 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/change
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bill":

### Wrong HTTP method: 405
GET http://localhost:8080/api/balance
